@startuml j4-whatsapp-reminder
title J4 WhatsApp reminder with a pay address
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam roundCorner 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam maxMessageSize 280
skinparam titleFontSize 17
skinparam titleFontColor #0E5C45
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #0E5C45
  LifeLineBorderColor #7FA89A
  ParticipantBorderColor #0E5C45
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  ActorBorderColor #0E5C45
  ActorBackgroundColor #E8F2EE
  GroupBorderColor #0E5C45
  GroupBackgroundColor #F3F8F6
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #B08A2E
  BackgroundColor #FFF8E6
  FontSize 12
}
actor "Shop owner" as Owner
participant "CustomerRow" as Row
participant "lib/ledger" as Ledger
participant "WhatsApp" as WA
actor "Customer" as Cust
participant "UPI app" as UPI

Row -> Ledger : balanceOf(customer)
Row -> Ledger : reminderHref(phone, name, balance, shopUpi, lang)
Ledger -> Ledger : reminderText: owes, advance or zero wording\nin English, Hindi or Telugu; the figure always "Rs 3,470"
alt balance above 0
  Ledger -> Ledger : adds " Pay: upi://pay?pa=<id>&am=<balance>&cu=INR"\nid = the shop's UPI id, or hisaab.demo@upi until one is set
else balance 0 or an advance
  Ledger -> Ledger : no pay address
end
Ledger --> Row : https://wa.me/91<phone>?text=<encoded text>
Row --> Owner : every row shows a Remind link with that address
Owner -> Row : taps Remind
Row -> WA : opens the link in a new tab
WA --> Owner : chat with the customer, the text already typed
Owner -> WA : presses Send
WA --> Cust : the reminder
opt the customer pays
  Cust -> UPI : uses the upi://pay address from the message
end
note over Row, Ledger
  Hisaab sends nothing itself and does not know whether the message was sent or paid.
  The owner records the payment as an entry (J2).
end note
@enduml
